    {"id":"kotohira_440","category":"geography","difficulty":"hard","question":"琴平町の面積（8.47km²）は東京ドーム約何個分ですか？","choices":["A. 約50個分","B. 約100個分","C. 約180個分","D. 約300個分"],"answer":"C","explanation":"東京ドームの面積は約0.047km²なので、8.47÷0.047≒約180個分です。","source":"konpie-bot/knowledge_base/geography","reviewed":True,"enabled":True},
    {"id":"kotohira_441","category":"event","difficulty":"easy","question":"金刀比羅宮の「お下がり」「お上がり」は何の祭りの行事ですか？","choices":["A. 桜花祭","B. 紅葉祭","C. 例大祭","D. 新酒祭"],"answer":"C","explanation":"お下がりとお上がりは例大祭（10月9日〜11日）の行事です。","source":"konpie-bot/knowledge_base/event","reviewed":True,"enabled":True},
